  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you today?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty good, thanks for asking.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I want a board game to play with my partner on quiet evenings.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.23,
   "block": "board_games.opt2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Listen to all of them first, then comment.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.45,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "describe_options",
   "phrasing": "describe_instr_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Take your time.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.23,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_09"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "One is a two player card game about trading spices, fast and really easy to set up.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.33,
   "block": "board_games.opt2",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Another is a puzzle style game where you build a pretty garden with tiles.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 1.62,
   "block": "board_games.opt2",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Or there's a long campaign game where the story changes every time you play.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 2.47,
   "block": "board_games.opt2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, that's all. Which sounds best to you?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 1.09,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "explicit",
   "phrasing": "describe_cue_08"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Do you two like to compete, or would you rather relax? For relaxing, the garden game is a lovely pick. If you want something to look forward to each week, try the campaign game.",
